title: Commvault License
agents: commvault_rest
catalog: app/other
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 Checks the CommCell license (GET /V4/License): license mode (not PRODUCTION
 is WARN) and remaining time until the expiry date (default WARN below 60
 days, CRIT below 30 days, CRIT if expired). Also shows over capacity, grace
 period and invalid license IP flags reported by GET /CommServ/LicenseUsage.
 Serial number and registration code are not fetched into the agent output.

discovery:
 One service on the CommServe host.
